00:00:04.693 --> 00:00:05.860
them so I got them.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.090
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh, I've done that.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.040
I've done that.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.010
I literally got it, it
was a half size big,

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.490
but I was like whatever, they're so cute.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:12.931
- [Jo Jo] It's fine, I'll grow into them.

00:00:12.931 --> 00:00:13.764
(laughter)

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:14.780
- [Kelly] You probably
will, you're so tall

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.180
and only 16, that's awesome.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.013
- Thank you.

00:00:17.013 --> 00:00:17.846
It's a good thing.

00:00:17.846 --> 00:00:19.540
- So why are bows your thing?

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.460
They were my thing too
because I was in dance

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.293
and all that growing up.

00:00:22.293 --> 00:00:23.375
- [Jo Jo] For sure.

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:24.440
That's how, that's actually
how they started for me.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.290
You know, when I was little my mom,

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.400
I mean I was two years old.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.570
When I was born actually,

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.300
my mom just kinda stuck them in my hair.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.100
And my joke is as I got older,

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.328
my bows just kept on getting bigger.

00:00:35.328 --> 00:00:36.161
(laughter)

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:40.620
But as I realize that bows
are like a part of my life,

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.610
I realize that I wanted
them to mean something.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.550
And so, what I came up
with is see-one-aters.

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:48.420
And so you're wearing a bow,

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:49.687
or you see someone wearing a bow,

00:00:49.687 --> 00:00:52.110
that means that they are see-one-ater.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.317
So say, you're, you know at school,

00:00:54.317 --> 00:00:57.400
or you don't have anyone
to play with at recess,

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.040
or you don't have anyone
to sit at lunch with.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:00.873
- Yeah.

00:01:00.873 --> 00:01:03.090
- [Jo Jo] If you see
someone wearing a Jo Jo bow,

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.980
you know that you can sit with them,

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:06.430
or you know that you can play with them.

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:07.550
Because that person--

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:08.383
- It's a safe place.

00:01:08.383 --> 00:01:10.349
- That's a safe place, that
person will be nice to you.

00:01:10.349 --> 00:01:11.869
(applause)

00:01:11.869 --> 00:01:12.702
- That's so cool.

00:01:12.702 --> 00:01:13.808
- That person will be kind do you.

00:01:13.808 --> 00:01:14.641
Yeah.

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:17.640
I actually, if you two are up for it,

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.928
I might have a little
present for you guys.

00:01:19.928 --> 00:01:21.136
- I am up for it.

00:01:21.136 --> 00:01:23.797
(cheering)

00:01:23.797 --> 00:01:24.635
- Jason.

00:01:24.635 --> 00:01:26.650
- [Jo Jo] I brought you and a bright bow

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.660
