00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:29.150
- I love that it's yellow
too cause sunflower

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.420
is my favorite flower.
- Well there you go.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:31.620
- Oh my gosh, I'm so into it.
- [Jo Jo] And Jason.

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:32.790
- Wait, here we go, watch this.

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.350
