00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:36.037
- Denim is my favorite color.

00:01:36.037 --> 00:01:38.287
(cheering)

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:40.608
- I love it.

00:01:40.608 --> 00:01:41.441
(cheering)

00:01:41.441 --> 00:01:42.616
- Oh yeah.

00:01:42.616 --> 00:01:43.449
- [Kelly] That is so sweet.

00:01:43.449 --> 00:01:44.430
