00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.620
got the back showing the front.

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:46.670
Okay.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:47.827
- My bad.

00:01:47.827 --> 00:01:48.660
- There you go.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:49.567
(cheering)

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:50.400
- [Kelly] That's.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:51.233
I am just letting you know,

00:01:51.233 --> 00:01:52.660
that's a real man that's
letting you touch his

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:53.560
cowboy hat.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.393
- Is it?

00:01:54.393 --> 00:01:56.530
- You can sit with me at lunch, it's fine.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:57.852
- You can sit with me at lunch.

00:01:57.852 --> 00:01:58.685
- Good.

00:01:58.685 --> 00:01:59.760
- I love that though. It's so kind.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.310
And it's such a good
thing because bullying

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:02.143
